_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/2f0af670552bc05016f5214e18cc5036.poster.avif?t=1787888847\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/2f0af670552bc05016f5214e18cc5036.webm?t=1787888847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/2f0af670552bc05016f5214e18cc5036.mp4?t=1787888847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Order drone delivery of new goods</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your store supplies are being replenished by drone delivery. Drone delivered goods will be dropped to your store's mailbox.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/61dee21721ff328ef82221964170ffd3.poster.avif?t=1787888847\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/61dee21721ff328ef82221964170ffd3.webm?t=1787888847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/61dee21721ff328ef82221964170ffd3.mp4?t=1787888847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Manage and upgrade your store</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each level of your store you unlock better tiers of products. Each store level makes you more efficient. Over time your store will expand with more customers and more products. It is only up to you how big your business will be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/5b1c5b9cc8c02abfc0120c62b7a4c8d7.poster.avif?t=1787888847\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/5b1c5b9cc8c02abfc0120c62b7a4c8d7.webm?t=1787888847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/5b1c5b9cc8c02abfc0120c62b7a4c8d7.mp4?t=1787888847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Satisfied space travelers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your store provides much needed rest and resupply for space travelers. Will you take the duty of running a space supermarket?</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/f27551eb9e76b1af427f99b7d0cc26e1.poster.avif?t=1787888847\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/f27551eb9e76b1af427f99b7d0cc26e1.webm?t=1787888847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/f27551eb9e76b1af427f99b7d0cc26e1.mp4?t=1787888847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fill up shelves</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your shelves stocked and nicely organized. Set optimal prices to balance customer satisfaction and maximize your store’s profit. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841050/extras/9848bfcfd919158c6936d862c6db4759.poster.avif?t=1787888847\" width=616 height=352 ><source 